,"kind":"announcement","title":"Tiny Harbor is Part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey folks,Tiny Harbor is part of Steam Next Fest! Play our demo to experience three of life's greatest wonders: 1. Adopting Cats 2. Being Around Cats 3. Seeing Felis catusJust kidding (or are we really?) You'll also get to build your own fishing harbor, unlock tons of cool fish, and decorate it however you'd like with the help of Maisie's Landscaping. If you like what you played or have any thoughts, please leave our demo a review! Thanks a bunch,Galago Group team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:39:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691866","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4921500-1845383656378028","game_id":"steam-4921500","kind":"announcement","title":"A 💙Tiny Harbor💙 is Waiting For You","summary":"We're proud to announce Tiny Harbor, launch the Steam page, and the demo! Tiny Harbor is a cozy idle management sim, and we hope it'll be your new companion. It can sit at the bottom of your desktop, growing bit by bit, as you work or relax. Watch our Announcement TrailerWho are We?We’re a three-person team from Sweden, and we’ve just announced our first game together: Tiny Harbor. The three of us, Adam, Robin and Johan, have worked together for years at different studios and on different games,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T15:24:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4921500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_a